# ns_t3al

- Load `AGENTS.md` in this extension first; follow `context/principles.md`.
- One Admin Tools module (`tools_NsT3al`, `ModuleController`) owns the UX. No AJAX routes, no second UI, no Extension Manager override.
- XLF writes only via Save / Create file; existing files are updated in place (`XliffDocumentUpdater` + `XliffFormatRestorer`) with minimal diffs. Never write TYPO3 Core English sources.
- AI is missing-only and batches are keyed + count-checked; results stay in the grid until Save.
- Permissions only via `ExtensionAccessService::canEdit()`.
- Must run on TYPO3 12.4 / 13.4 / 14.3 and PHP 8.1–8.5 — see `context/core.md` → Compatibility.
- Never log or print API keys, the Crowdin token or ns_license settings; QA never reaches the license server.
- Do not restore removed UI listed in `context/session-state.md`.
- New labels go into `locallang.xlf` and `de.locallang.xlf`.
- Edit skills in `.agents/skills/`, then run `.agents/scripts/link-skills.sh`.
